sVKrcvPHZaC9aXrgv27NNE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSDldHphV_vm9243IutsYprneYbBaREFcQ3YUHrWC23yw&oe=6B045D63"}, "display_name": "BodyWorks", "keywords": ["anatomy", "Body", "health", "medical", "education"], "long_description": "CREATE. EDUCATE. LEARN. SHARE - A virtual reality anatomy studio. \n\nDiscover a revolutionary virtual reality anatomy studio. Explain complex anatomy in minutes with simple, high-impact videos. \n\nBodyWorks is not a game.  It is a powerful tool for educators, healthcare providers, and content creators.\n\n- Learn faster\n- Simplify concepts for learners and patients\n- Visualize concepts and structures \n- Stand out in your class \n- Build confidence for the OR\n\n7 Day Free Trial!  Subscription required.\n\nDisclaimer: Body Works does not make health-related claims or provide content related to the diagnosis, mitigation, cure, or treatment of a disease or medical condition; additionally, Body Works is not a medical device, medical content, or software for medical devices.", "short_description": "CREATE. EDUCATE. LEARN. SHARE - A virtual reality anatomy studio. \n\nDiscover a revolutionary virtual reality anatomy studio. Explain complex anatomy in minutes with simple, high-impact videos.\n\nBodyWorks is not a game.  It is a powerful tool for educators, healthcare providers, and content creators.  Check-in frequently for new anatomy and feature updates!\n\n7 Day Free Trial!  Subscription required."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.precisionostech.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.precisionostech.com/terms-of-use/", "publisher_name": "PrecisionOS Technology", "support_website_url": "https://support.precisionostech.com/knowledge", "website_url": "https://www.precisionostech.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}